      "text": "Aaa - finally finished the first 100 pages, 100 more left to go.. I still need to edit the first 100, which might take a month or so.\n\nIt is weird to think that three whole novellas that I finished writing are in total 120.\n\nBasically, when I finish the 200 in full, I will make it a whole novella by itself, therefore making the count four, and then stitch it with the first three to make a proper book, 300+ pages and so, publishing houses who reviewed my work liked it immensely, but said they will only take it if the page count surpasses three hundred.\n\nWell, life goes on.",
